<title>USA: First USA Paymentech Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>First USA Paymentech Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			  7,360		    3,888</p>
<p> Net revs		  50,630		   31,607</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  35,197		   24,816</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.37		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			 12,472		    8,822</p>
<p> Net revs		 140,670		   87,368</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,254		   25,546</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First USA Paymentech Inc said for the nine months ended March 31, earnings before a one-time acquisition-related charge increased to $22.1 million or $0.67 a share, compared with net income of $8.8 million or $0.36 a share for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>The one-time charge for the first nine months of 1997 was $9.7 million, after-tax, related to the acquisition of GENSAR.</p>
